  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 71002845184
    m_Localized: 'Found someone''s smartphone in the 1st floor hallway and checked
      a recent text message. The message was still unread.


      [Text Message]

      Hello,
      Writer Kang Minjae.

      This is the Neulbom New Spring Literary Award Committee.

      We
      are pleased to inform you that your work ''But the Dawn Comes'' has been selected
      for the 2025 Neulbom New Spring Literary Award.

      Congratulations on your
      achievement.

      We will contact you with further details.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 95078150144
    m_Localized: '[What to Do]

      Equipping the Soul Visor allows you to see
      the dead souls. Make contact with Saja who came from the afterlife.


      [About
      the Incident]

      The incident occurred on November 29, 20XX.

      According
      to police press materials, out of 24 total residents in the building, 14 survivors
      have been confirmed, meaning the estimated death toll is 10.


      [Resident
      Information]

      1st Floor: 5 people

      2nd Floor: 5 people

      3rd
      Floor: 6 people

      4th Floor: 7 people

      Rooftop: 1 person'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2129435055378432
    m_Localized: Room 302 - Landlord's Notice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995429533995008
    m_Localized: 1F Hallway - Text Message Record
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995569690857472
    m_Localized: Case File
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2129531797000192
    m_Localized: Room 301 - Absence Memo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2129609014136832
    m_Localized: Room 303 - Memo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2129513266565120
    m_Localized: 'Found a notice from the landlord in Room 302.


      [Noise-Related
      Notice]

      Recently, nighttime noise complaints have been filed from the
      3rd floor.

      Residents on the 3rd floor, please keep quiet after midnight.

      Affected
      households: Kim Heejae, Park Junseo, Park Hayun, Lee Sunja, Choi Sua'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2129552202289152
    m_Localized: 'Found a memo notifying an absence schedule.


      [Memo]

      To
      Sua,

      We''ll be away on a trip from 11/28 to 12/7. If any packages arrive
      at our place, please contact 010-XXXX-XXXX.

      - Heejae & Hayun'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2129631109730304
    m_Localized: 'Found a memo someone wrote in Room 303.


      [Memo]

      I
      found Mr. Junseo''s mother wandering in front of the Sarang Flower Shop,

      so
      I brought her home.

      It seems her dementia symptoms have returned...

      Just
      wanted to let you know in case you were worried!!

      - Sua'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2390516923387904
    m_Localized: Room 202 - Diary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2390576151154688
    m_Localized: Room 201 - Messenger Record
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2390554961530880
    m_Localized: 'Found someone''s diary in Room 202. The cover has ''Jeong Hangyeol''
      written in neat handwriting.


      [November 29 Diary Entry]

      I picked
      up a small keyring in the hallway. Could it belong to Ms. Yuna from Room 201?
      I should ask her if I run into her later.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2390592450220032
    m_Localized: "Found someone's smartphone in Room 201. Checked the recent messenger
      records.\n\n[Messenger Record]\n(A: Phone owner, B: Another person)\nB: Ms.
      Seo, you didn't look well at work today. Are you okay?\nA: Thank you for your
      concern \u3160\u3160 I lost a keyring I always carried in my bag...\nB: Oh
      really? I'll check with the building management team.\nA: Hehe, thank you so
      much! :D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2416800135139328
    m_Localized: Room 401 - Diary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2417426252451840
    m_Localized: Room 401 - Landlord's Note
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2417470770794496
    m_Localized: Room 402 - Drawing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2417525376438272
    m_Localized: Room 402 - Diary
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2417342353788928
    m_Localized: 'Found someone''s diary in Room 401. The cover has ''Kim Y. H.''
      written in round, cute handwriting.


      [Diary Entry]

      Today I brought
      a lovely child home. I gave her my last name. Now we''re family!

      Ms.
      Arin upstairs invited us to come play later. We should definitely go~

      If
      all three of us with the same last name gather, it''ll feel like we''re siblings
      lolol'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2417453960024064
    m_Localized: 'Found a note from the landlord.


      [Note]

      Just so you
      know, it seems like your puppy and the youngest child from Room 402 often go
      into Room 403. That room is empty, but please make sure they don''t go in there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2417483987046400
    m_Localized: 'Found a drawing that looks like it was drawn by a child in Room
      402. It appears to be a family portrait. I noted down the labels written on
      the drawing.


      [Drawing Labels]

      Dad: Choi Yohan

      Mom: Jeong
      Naeun (This figure has wings drawn on it.)

      Big Brother: Choi Woojin

      And
      me!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2417541755195392
    m_Localized: 'Found someone''s diary in Room 402. The cover has ''Lee Miyeon''
      written in firmly pressed handwriting.


      [Diary Entry]

      Sejin likes
      Cheolsu from Room 401 way too much. I feel bad for Ms. Younghee... But I think
      it''s better than awkwardly being alone with her as her new stepmother. Still,
      I should tell her not to go to Room 403 too often.

      * Memo: Mr. Yohan''s
      business trip 11/25~31, Woojin''s retreat 11/28~30'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
